  "description": "WrestleMania is the flagship annual pay-per-view event of WWE (World Wrestling Entertainment), often considered the most prestigious and widely watched professional wrestling event in the world. It features major championship matches and is known for its high production value, dramatic storylines, and iconic moments. The background knowledge of WrestleMania is necessary to understand the setting and the context of Hulk Hogan’s appearance.",
